  "question": {
    "text": "In the following arrangement, the system is initially held at rest by an external agent. At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> block is released. If the acceleration of block&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then find the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>. Assume that the pulleys and strings are massless and smooth. [<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9.8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>]<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image29-72fa48c5-cbb5-436f-9438-c045efef259b.jpg\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Block B will not move<br /><br /><math><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> ...(i)<br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math> ...(ii)<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image30-17999e0d-727a-477c-b7ab-68d485245875.jpg\" /><br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9.8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0.7</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>",
